# The image build context lives under $PX_OUT/images/, never in the tree.
# scripts/stage-artifacts.sh fills it with the files of docker/image at its
# root, the fetched distributions under dist/, the local Phoenix build under
# phoenix/ and the enabled plug-ins under plugins/. This file excludes
# everything first, then admits exactly those entries again, so a file that
# no step staged cannot reach the image. A new entry of docker/image needs an
# admit line here too, or the build that copies it fails.
*
!Dockerfile
!*.sh
!bin/
!conf/
!lib/
!dist/
!phoenix/
!plugins/

# Leftovers inside the admitted entries.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.log
